{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日一名RTX 5070用户在社交平台分享了自己的顯卡供電接口熔毀的經歷，<strong>與此前多起顯卡16Pin接口燒毀事件不同，這次出現明顯熔毀的是電源一側的8Pin接口，顯卡端16Pin接口則沒有明顯損壞。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588164.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.355644+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:19:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_hash":"023151efc36bbe443837d045b339bad23205ecb5192c0abaa3b070f2e788649a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}